{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "把答案理解为第一个大于等于 target 的位置，并在左闭右开区间 [left, right) 中二分查找。每轮比较 nums[mid]：若它小于 target，就舍弃左半部分；否则保留 mid 并继续向左寻找。区间收缩到 left = right 时，该位置既可能是目标索引，也可能是有序插入点。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>搜索插入位置可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;min-height:auto;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.panel-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.rule{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.accent{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.muted{color:#8d8d8d}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center}\n.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.array,.chars,.row-wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.cell,.char,.num-cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:600 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:.3s}\n.cell .idx,.char .index,.index,.marker{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px;font-weight:400}\n.cell.active,.cell.mid,.cell.current,.cell.found,.cell.max,.char.active,.num-cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.cell.out,.cell.discarded{opacity:.35}\n.card{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30}\n.card-label{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:4px}\n.card-value{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}\n.progress{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.dot,.pill{flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:#3c3c3c;transition:background .3s}\n.dot.on,.pill.on{background:#3794ff}\n.pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\n.pills .pill{flex:none;height:auto;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;color:#8d8d8d}\n.pills .pill.active,.pills .pill.on{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.status{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45;min-height:auto}\n\n.badge{padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;font-size:10px}\n.badge.target{border-color:#3794ff;color:#3794ff}\n.array{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,60px);gap:6px;margin-top:6px}\n.cell{min-height:48px;text-align:center}\n.cell .value{font-size:14px;font-weight:700}\n.cell .markers{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;min-height:14px}\n.range{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;font-size:12px}\n.decision{color:#d4d4d4}\n.rule-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:8px}\n.rule{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n.summary{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3794ff;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n@media(max-width:520px){.rule-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n\n.array .cell{width:60px}.cell .markers{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px}.cell.active .markers{color:#fff}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>二分找第一个 ≥ target 的位置</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">区间 <span class=\"mono\">[left, right)</span>，初始 <span class=\"mono\">right = nums.length</span>。</p>\n<section class=\"panel\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n<div class=\"row\"><span class=\"badge\" id=\"exampleName\">示例 1</span><span class=\"badge mono\">[1,3,5,6]</span><span class=\"badge target mono\" id=\"targetLabel\">target = 5</span></div>\n<div class=\"array\" id=\"array\"></div>\n<div class=\"range mono\" id=\"range\"></div>\n<div class=\"status\" id=\"status\"></div>\n<div class=\"progress\" id=\"progress\"></div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"rule-grid\"><div class=\"rule\"><strong class=\"mono accent\">nums[mid] &lt; target</strong><br>left = mid + 1</div><div class=\"rule\"><strong class=\"mono accent\">nums[mid] ≥ target</strong><br>right = mid</div></div>\n<div class=\"summary\">终止于 <span class=\"mono\">left = right</span>，即答案或插入点 · <span class=\"mono\">O(log n)</span></div>\n</main>\n<script>\n\n(() => {\n  const nums = [1, 3, 5, 6];\n  const examples = [\n    { target: 5, result: 2, steps: [\n      { l: 0, r: 4, m: null, text: '初始化搜索区间 [0, 4)。' },\n      { l: 0, r: 4, m: 2, text: 'mid = 2，nums[2] = 5 ≥ 5：保留 mid，令 right = 2。' },\n      { l: 0, r: 2, m: 1, text: 'mid = 1，nums[1] = 3 < 5：舍弃左侧，令 left = 2。' },\n      { l: 2, r: 2, m: null, text: '区间为空，left = right = 2；目标值就在索引 2。', done: true }\n    ]},\n    { target: 2, result: 1, steps: [\n      { l: 0, r: 4, m: null, text: '初始化搜索区间 [0, 4)。' },\n      { l: 0, r: 4, m: 2, text: 'mid = 2，nums[2] = 5 ≥ 2：答案可能更靠左，令 right = 2。' },\n      { l: 0, r: 2, m: 1, text: 'mid = 1，nums[1] = 3 ≥ 2：继续向左，令 right = 1。' },\n      { l: 0, r: 1, m: 0, text: 'mid = 0，nums[0] = 1 < 2：令 left = 1。' },\n      { l: 1, r: 1, m: null, text: 'left = right = 1；2 应插在 1 与 3 之间，返回 1。', done: true }\n    ]},\n    { target: 7, result: 4, steps: [\n      { l: 0, r: 4, m: null, text: '初始化搜索区间 [0, 4)，右边界 4 代表数组末尾之后。' },\n      { l: 0, r: 4, m: 2, text: 'mid = 2，nums[2] = 5 < 7：令 left = 3。' },\n      { l: 3, r: 4, m: 3, text: 'mid = 3，nums[3] = 6 < 7：令 left = 4。' },\n      { l: 4, r: 4, m: null, text: 'left = right = 4；所有元素都小于 7，应插在数组末尾。', done: true }\n    ]}\n  ];\n\n  const arrayEl = document.getElementById('array');\n  const rangeEl = document.getElementById('range');\n  const statusEl = document.getElementById('status');\n  const progressEl = document.getElementById('progress');\n  let exampleIndex = 0;\n  let stepIndex = 0;\n\n  function render() {\n    const example = examples[exampleIndex];\n    const step = example.steps[stepIndex];\n    document.getElementById('exampleName').textContent = `示例 ${exampleIndex + 1}`;\n    document.getElementById('targetLabel').textContent = `target = ${example.target}`;\n\n    arrayEl.innerHTML = '';\n    nums.forEach((value, index) => {\n      const cell = document.createElement('div');\n      cell.className = 'cell';\n      if (step.done && index === example.result && example.result < nums.length) cell.classList.add('active');\n      else if (index === step.m) cell.classList.add('active');\n      else if (index < step.l || index >= step.r) cell.classList.add('discarded');\n\n      const labels = [];\n      if (index === step.l && step.l < nums.length) labels.push('left');\n      if (index === step.m) labels.push('mid');\n      if (index === step.r && step.r < nums.length) labels.push('right');\n      if (step.done && index === example.result && example.result < nums.length) labels.push('答案');\n      cell.innerHTML = `<div class=\"value\">${value}</div><div class=\"index\">索引 ${index}</div><div class=\"markers\">${labels.map(label => '<span>'+label+'</span>').join('') || ' '}</div>`;\n      arrayEl.appendChild(cell);\n    });\n\n    const rightNote = step.r === nums.length ? '（数组末尾之后）' : '';\n    rangeEl.textContent = `left = ${step.l}，right = ${step.r} ${rightNote}，当前区间 [${step.l}, ${step.r})`;\n    statusEl.innerHTML = `<span class=\"decision\">${step.text}</span>${step.done ? `<br><span class=\"mono\">输出：${example.result}</span>` : ''}`;\n    progressEl.innerHTML = example.steps.map((_, i) => `<span class=\"dot ${i === stepIndex ? 'on' : ''}\"></span>`).join('');\n  }\n\n  render();\n  setInterval(() => {\n    stepIndex++;\n    if (stepIndex >= examples[exampleIndex].steps.length) {\n      stepIndex = 0;\n      exampleIndex = (exampleIndex + 1) % examples.length;\n    }\n    render();\n  }, 1900);\n})();\n\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
